STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:7%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We expect to borrow money to purchase assets. We have adopted a policy to limit our aggregate borrowing to 65% of the value of the cost of our assets
