SIZE="2"><I>Ownership of Partnership Interests.</I>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In the case of a REIT that is a partner in a partnership, Treasury regulations provide that the REIT is deemed to own its proportionate share of the partnership&#146;s
