FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Disregarded Subsidiaries.</I>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If a REIT owns a corporate subsidiary that is a &#147;qualified REIT subsidiary,&#148; that subsidiary is disregarded for U.S. federal income tax purposes, and
