STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:7%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Taxable Subsidiaries.</I>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A REIT, in general, may jointly elect with a subsidiary corporation, whether or not wholly owned, to
