FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">CB Richard Ellis Realty Trust, a Maryland real estate investment trust (the &#147;Company&#148;), has adopted a dividend reinvestment program (the &#147;Plan&#148;), the terms and conditions of which are set forth
